<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to tender for 99,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to tender for 99,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Flour Mills Association will tender on Thursday for 99,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat in three 33,000-tonne shipments, traders said on Monday.</p>
</text>
